o<threading_passes> sub
(Explicitly enable infinite blend tolerance to test pull-out constraint)
G64 P0.0 Q0.0
G0 X.2 Y0 Z0
M3 S600
o<thread_pass> call [-.1] [-2] [#3]
S750
o<thread_pass> call [-.2] [-2] [#3]
S900
o<thread_pass> call [-.3] [-2] [#3]
S1200
o<thread_pass> call [-.4] [-2] [#3]
S1800
o<thread_pass> call [-.5] [-2] [#3]
M5
o<threading_passes> endsub
M2

o<thread_pass> sub 
(PRINT,In threading pass with depth #1)
G0 X#1
G33 Z#2 K#3
G0 X0.1 (Should be exact-path)
G91.2 Z.1 X.1 (Should be blended aggressively)
Z-.1
G91.2 Z.1 X-0.1
o<thread_pass> endsub
